'''The Unshattered Will''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Archon Kite Shield}}.

==Modifiers==
{{c|mod|Grants Summon Harbinger of Focus Skill}}: Summons an immortal Harbinger [[minion]]. The minion will occasionally apply "The Unshattered Will" on the player character while the player character is channeling. "The Unshattered Will" is a buff that lasts 4 seconds, with a cooldown of 8 seconds, and grants the following benefits:

*Immunity to elemental [[ailments]]
*[[Stun]] immunity
* 20% less damage taken

==Mechanics==
* {{sl|Summon Harbinger of Focus}}

{{Item acquisition}}

When the unique pieces are placed correctly in the inventory or stash, they will all vanish, and the player will be left with the forged unique item.

Since item pieces are drop disabled. To acquire this unique, players are requires to acquire the individual pieces, or the shield directly.
